      "evidence": "Traced path in the reviewed tree: delegation/dispatch_phase.go:667 passes `Root: s.root, SettingsFile: s.settingsPath()`. dispatch/build.go:443 calls `admittedRequest(p.LookupEnv, p.Root, p.Runtime, permissions)`, ignoring p.SettingsFile. dispatch/codexsandbox.go:37-44 opens Root/metasystem.conf, where the worktree's tracked file has no launch.codex.sandbox, so it uses the default workspace-write and the request is not widened. adapter/codex.go:189-200 (CodexAdmittedSandbox) returns workspace-write without widenedBy, and supervisor/codex.go:165 launches the job round with that mode. Meanwhile supervisor/codex.go:123, the host-turn path, now reads the primary's danger-full-access through d.configValue, so the two paths disagree. The primary's metasystem.conf.local:62 holds `launch.codex.sandbox=danger-full-access`. The fix is to pass dispatchSettingsPath(p.Root, p.SettingsFile) at build.go:443.",
